<section class="content-section"><div class="wrap page-split"><div><p class="section-kicker">ABOUT THE PRODUCT</p><h2 style="font-family:'DM Sans',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:700">Timenox for real-world workflows.</h2><p>Timenox supports attendance workflows with features such as QR-based check-in and check-out, location and photo verification options, shift scheduling and reporting. The right setup depends on the organisation’s requirements and devices.</p><p>Before adopting any operational software, confirm feature availability, data handling, device compatibility and rollout requirements for your organisation.</p></div><div><ol class="page-list"><li><span>01</span><div><strong>Attendance workflows</strong><p>Structured check-in and check-out processes for teams.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Verification options</strong><p>Depending on configuration, support may include GPS and photo verification.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>Shift and reporting needs</strong><p>Help teams organise schedules and review attendance information.</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><strong>Browser-based access</strong><p>A web-based approach that should be evaluated against device policies and connectivity needs.</p></div></li></ol></div></div></section>
